<title>UK: San Paolo Bank sets call and put warrants on Gilt.</title>
<headline>San Paolo Bank sets call and put warrants on Gilt.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Istituto Bancario San Paolo Di Torino, London branch says it has issued 1,000 call and put warrants, in two equal tranches, on the 7.0 percent gilt due June 2002.</p>
<p> WARRANT	STRIKE	GEARING</p>
<p> CALL A	 99.27	 123.0 TIMES</p>
<p> PUT B	  97.27	  76.5 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   17.DEC.97</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  98.27</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
